1
00:00:00,039 --> 00:00:01,409
(Penny:)Yeah, I don't need
anything around

2
00:00:01,407 --> 00:00:03,577
(Penny:)that I can stab myself with.

3
00:00:03,576 --> 00:00:05,006
(Sheldon:)Wonderful,

4
00:00:05,011 --> 00:00:06,241
(Sheldon:)Longclaw is mine.

5
00:00:06,246 --> 00:00:08,216
(Sheldon:)And how about you keep

6
00:00:08,214 --> 00:00:10,414
(Sheldon:)our... avocado plant?

7
00:00:14,387 --> 00:00:16,987
(Leonard:)Sounds right--
a limited edition collectible

8
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:18,360
(Leonard:)worth hundreds of dollars

9
00:00:18,358 --> 00:00:19,588
(Leonard:)and a thing

10
00:00:19,592 --> 00:00:22,632
(Leonard:)that grew out of a thing
we fished from the trash.

11
00:00:22,629 --> 00:00:25,529
(Sheldon:)Although, Amy and I did
just move in together,

12
00:00:25,532 --> 00:00:28,162
(Sheldon:)and a plant is
a lovely housewarming gift.

13
00:00:28,168 --> 00:00:30,268
(Leonard:)Fine, take the plant.

14
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:31,770
(Sheldon:)Oh, we got a sword
and a plant;

15
00:00:31,771 --> 00:00:33,341
(Sheldon:)our apartment's
really shaping up.

16
00:00:36,843 --> 00:00:38,643
(Bernadette:)Stuart, you didn't have
to get us a baby gift.

17
00:00:38,645 --> 00:00:39,915
(Sheldon:)Oh.

18
00:00:39,913 --> 00:00:42,443
(Stuart:)Just homemade coupons for things
you might need help with

19
00:00:42,448 --> 00:00:43,848
(Stuart:)before the baby gets here.

20
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:46,950
(Stuart:)Going to the grocery store,
driving you to the doctor.

21
00:00:46,953 --> 00:00:50,253
(Stuart:)If you're not in a hurry,
I can dig you a koi pond.

22
00:00:52,225 --> 00:00:54,125
(Bernadette:)A foot massage?

23
00:00:54,127 --> 00:00:57,457
(Stuart:)And that's not me being creepy,
that's for either of you.

24
00:00:59,632 --> 00:01:02,772
(Howard:)This is very nice,
Stuart, thank you.

